  "description": "A Windows installer for .NET products, built in WPF: a per-machine Setup.exe with a wizard, silent modes, upgrades with rollback, a Windows service, shortcuts, an \"Apps & features\" entry and its own uninstaller. The program files are embedded at build time. Accepts the Inno Setup command line (/SILENT, /VERYSILENT, /SUPPRESSMSGBOXES, /LOG, /DIR, /TASKS) and exit codes, and takes over an existing Inno Setup installation, so a product can move from Inno Setup without changing its update mechanism or its IT scripts.",
